<div class="bhd-page__keypoints" aria-label="Current research rules">
  <div><strong>No result before data</strong><span>A planned protocol, grant concept or pilot question is not described as evidence of effectiveness.</span></div>
  <div><strong>Multiple measures</strong><span>Hydration is complex. Where feasible, research should combine complementary measures rather than rely on one spot urine value or one subjective signal.</span></div>
  <div><strong>Stage is part of the evidence</strong><span>Protocol development, ethics review, recruitment, data collection, analysis and publication are separate milestones.</span></div>
</div>

